        {
          "source": "fda-metoprolol",
          "section": "8.1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "lactation": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary Limited available data from published literature report that metoprolol is present in human milk.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-metoprolol",
          "section": "8.2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pediatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب برای کودکان شرط، محدودیت سنی یا نکته دارد؛ جمله برچسب در زیر آمده است.",
        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "Safety and effectiveness of metoprolol tartrate have not been established in pediatric patients.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-metoprolol",
          "section": "8.4"
        }
      ]
    },
    "geriatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در سالمندان با احتیاط و معمولاً از دوز پایین شروع شود.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "Clinical studies of metoprolol tartrate in hypertension did not include sufficient numbers of subjects aged 65 and over to determine whether they respond differently from younger subjects.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-metoprolol",
          "section": "8.5"
        }
      ]
    },
